==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Duche]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
The peons here should provide you with ample cash to slowly chip away at THE SLOTH with strong attackers like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]. Gacha units like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] help immensely at speeding up this process.

